    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 31 Answer: Help her figure out what's strange</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>

    <div class="verify-note">Live play check (game v1.1.8) confirmed the poster, coat, strap and panel moves — and showed several findings are drags, not taps. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object instead. The full 13-step sequence is cross-checked against an independent all-levels reference.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>A spot-the-weirdness level in a haunted subway car — and the trick is that most findings are drags, not taps: drag the demon poster over the ghostly window, drag the woman's coat onto the bloodstain, swipe down the wobbling ring, swipe down the teddy bear to open its battery compartment, and fix the ceiling panel with the toolbox hammer. The phone gets signal only at the end — dragging it to the girl early does nothing.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The video is the fastest way to copy this level move-for-move — some moves are drags, not taps, and text alone can't show the gesture. Timestamps for every move are in the walkthrough below.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/VtOrg4WJ19o" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 31 walkthrough video" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>

    <h2>Level 31 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 1</span>
      <strong>Drag the demon poster onto the window to cover the ghost</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l28_step1.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 31 step 1" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Live-verified: tapping the ghost does nothing — you must drag the creepy poster from the wall over the window (cut it loose with the backpack scissors first if it won't move). Tape from the backpack also covers the window.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VtOrg4WJ19o&amp;t=9s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:09</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 2</span>
      <strong>Drag the woman's coat onto the blood-red liquid</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l28_step2.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 31 step 2" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Live-verified: the red puddle on the floor only reacts when you drag her coat over it. Tapping the puddle does nothing.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VtOrg4WJ19o&amp;t=20s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:20</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 3</span>
      <strong>Swipe down the wobbling ring, swipe down the teddy bear, then fix the ceiling panel</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l28_step3.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 31 step 3" loading="lazy" />
      <p>Live-verified: the hanging strap reacts to a downward swipe. The teddy bear in the bottom-right corner swipes down too — it opens a battery compartment. Open the toolbox and drag the nails and hammer onto the loose ceiling panel above.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VtOrg4WJ19o&amp;t=29s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:29</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 4</span>
      <strong>Throw the high heels at the static TV, spray the under-seat area, then hand over the phone</strong>
      <img src="/brain-puzzle-3/l28_step4.jpg" alt="Brain Puzzle 3 level 31 step 4" loading="lazy" />
      <p>The heels fix the snowy TV. Drag the fire extinguisher to the area under the floor to deal with what is hiding there. Only once the carriage calms down does the phone get signal — drag the phone to the girl to trigger the dream-ending. Dragging it earlier does nothing.</p>
      <p class="ts">Video check: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VtOrg4WJ19o&amp;t=50s" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">0:50</a></p>
    </div>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
   
    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 31?</summary><p>Work through the creepy subway car: drag the poster over the ghost window, drag the coat onto the red liquid, swipe down the ring and the teddy bear, fix the ceiling panel with the toolbox hammer, throw the heels at the TV, spray the under-seat area with the fire extinguisher, and finally hand the girl her phone. The phone-signal cutscene ends the level.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why won't my taps do anything in Level 31?</summary><p>Because most of this level is drags, not taps. Live checks on game v1.1.8 confirmed the poster-over-window, coat-over-bloodstain, strap-downward and panel moves are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object somewhere useful instead.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why is there no phone signal in Level 31?</summary><p>The signal only returns once enough of the creepy set dressing has been cleared. Don't drag the phone to the girl early — the game even warns against it. Finish the other fixes first, then the phone gets signal and handing it over ends the level.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is Level 31 the same as Subway Panic?</summary><p>Yes. Subway Panic is level 31 in the current version of Brain Puzzle 3: Crazy Mind. Older walkthroughs and videos may label it level 28 — the game has added levels since, shifting the numbering.</p></details>

